        },
        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "Life Is Strange: Reunion is the thrilling finale to the Max and Chloe saga, a chapter that brings their book to a close. This is a full circle moment for both developers and fans—one that builds on everything that has come before. And even as the game delivers a reunion long-thought impossible, it also caps off our time at Caledon University in a literal blaze of glory.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
